report:
- unmapped config.speechRate at /config/speechRate: player configuration (speech, scale announcements, time units) has no v0.1 equivalent; the spoken legend follows SDR-18
- unmapped tone.filter at /tone/filter: audio filters on tones have no v0.1 equivalent
- approximated tone.type at /tone/type: instrument `piano` is passed through by name; instruments beyond the oscillators arrive with AXONOTE (C04)
- unmapped encoding.panAzimuth at /encoding/panAzimuth: 3D spatial positions arrive with spatial audio (D03); v0.1 has stereo pan only
- unmapped encoding.pitch.roundToNote at /encoding/pitch/roundToNote: Analysis mode keeps pitch continuous (SDR-10); quantization arrives with AXONOTE in Presentation mode (C04)
- unmapped encoding.repeat at /encoding/repeat: data-driven repetition over categories has no v0.1 equivalent; split the data into one track per category with `filter`
- approximated transform.filter at /transform/0/filter: the JavaScript expression `datum.n > 10 && datum.island !== 'None'` is translated to `n > 10 && island != "None"`; check it against the SONARITHM expression language
- approximated transform.calculate at /transform/1/calculate: the JavaScript expression `Math.sqrt(datum.n)` is translated to `sqrt(n)`; check it against the SONARITHM expression language
- unmapped transform.fold at /transform/2: no v0.1 transform (fold, density, quantile, boxplot and diffing are not in spec v0.1)
